# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SAP Advanced Event Mesh — Event Portal REST API (v2)
#
# 1. Log in to your AEM Cloud Console
# 2. Go to: Token Management → Create API Token
#    Assign roles: Event Portal Designer (read + write)
# 3. Paste the generated token below
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
AEM_CLOUD_BASE_URL=https://api.solace.cloud
AEM_API_TOKEN=your-aem-api-token-here